 "transcript": [
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Why do you not come in to your father and eat a little food?\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"We have been to the officer's house, father, and the house is very fine and the food is very fine and I have a new wife and my brother is very rich and has a great grain market and it is very fine and we are well and you are not in the house and it is a good thing and we are well and you are not in the house.\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung enters, sees his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"I have been to the officer's house and have a new wife and my brother is very rich and has a great grain market and it is very fine and we are well and you are not in the house and it is a good thing and we are well and you are not in the house.\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] Wang Lung turns away, feeling ignored.",
  "[action] The eldest son watches Wang Lung closely.",
